
"smart_sources:Flora - Memory Books/113 - Family Lunch Revelation.md": {"path":"Flora - Memory Books/113 - Family Lunch Revelation.md","last_embed":{"hash":null},"embeddings":{},"last_read":{"hash":"6kauxt","at":1777331817827},"class_name":"SmartSource","last_import":{"mtime":1777331039010,"size":3848,"at":1777331817893,"hash":"6kauxt"},"blocks":{"#---frontmatter---":[1,24],"#113 - Family Lunch Revelation":[26,27],"#113 - Family Lunch Revelation#{1}":[27,27]},"outlinks":[],"metadata":{"type":"lore","status":"active","priority":50,"tags":["#lorebook"],"keys":["Ryan Adame","Queen Maya","family lunch revelation","backstory reveal","golden thread","consciousness projection","Palace of Loth Logan","Althena","Ryan's torture and rescue","Estra"],"position":"after","depth":4,"summary":"**Entry: Family Lunch Revelation (ID: 113)**  \\n**What it is:** A narrative scene (June 21, 1843, 12:22–1:52 PM) where Ryan Adame reveals his full backstory to his biological mother, Queen Maya, in a private audience, followed by a formal family lunch with his wives and allies.  \\n\\n**Selection trigger:** Inject when Ryan is explaining his origin, trauma, or divine power to Maya; when Maya reflects on Althena's silence vs. Ryan's favor; during a family reconciliation or confrontation; or when Charlotte or Estra must justify their loyalty to Ryan over their blood families.  \\n\\n**Key relationships:**\\n- **Ryan & Maya:** Biological mother-son; Maya learns his torture, amnesia, rescue of sisters, triad marriage, Estra's defection, Loren's wounding, and divine wedding. She apologizes for absence and asks to join his life. \\n- **Ryan & Charlotte:** Charlotte chooses Ryan over her mother Loren (who tortured him).\\n- **Ryan & Estra:** Former Duranian assassin who defected and married Ryan; Maya questions her directly.\\n- **Supporting cast:** Sisters Mina & Cora, wives Florence & Estra, allies Alec, William, Howard, Rachael.","location":"Duran","scene_type":"revelation","character_present":["Ryan","Charlotte","Florence","Estra","Queen Maya"]},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[]},"smart_blocks:Flora - Memory Books/113 - Family Lunch Revelation.md#---frontmatter---": {"path":null,"last_embed":{"hash":null},"embeddings":{},"text":null,"length":0,"last_read":{"hash":"1d0d9ej","at":1777331817827},"key":"Flora - Memory Books/113 - Family Lunch Revelation.md#---frontmatter---","lines":[1,24],"size":1559,"outlinks":[],"class_name":"SmartBlock"},
